      "comment": "Ulrike: Thoma",
      "content": "Her son Thoma has a Mondstadter mother and an Inazuman father. He grew up in Mondstadt, then set out for Inazuma by boat with a cargo of Dandelion Wine meant for his father; a wave threw him overboard and he washed up in Inazuma with nothing, later becoming the Kamisato Clan's trusted housekeeper. He writes to her and sends gifts, among them Inazuman snacks that she shared with her fellow Knights.",
